From 4fa373119afeb90a7e915ffbb12f1efeb03ecb24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:06:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Stage 2: add VIP and Critic customers

- VIPCustomer: loses 12 satisfaction per waiting turn, 10% off every bill.
- CriticCustomer: loses 10 per waiting turn and reviews the restaurant when
  served: satisfaction >= 70 gives a glowing review (+15), below 70 a harsh
  one (-15).
- Customer gains discountPercent(), billFor(dish) and an onServed() hook
  that receiveDish() calls; the Waiter locks billFor() into the order and
  shows the customer's reaction when serving.
- Money.discount() applies a percentage rounding half up in whole cents.
- ArrivalSchedule now brings in Regular, VIP, Critic, Regular, VIP, Critic.
- GameController and ConsoleUI are unchanged: the new types work through
  polymorphism alone.
- Add Stage 2 demo runs, test notes, README rules and the diagram source.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HSkBQ1HcQjFxrQp6GUXsrc
